      "title": "[正面] First off, mfs here are complaining for all the wr...",
      "summary": "First off, mfs here are complaining for all the wrong reasons, they geniunely play this like a regular gacha where power is king and you have to be better than everyone else, so here how not be giga gamer elite if you want:\n\n1. The game is extremely generous and you can get characters very easily, even if you didn't save up for them beforehand,\n\n2. While each character have 3 main upgrade and 12 notch, you does not need them all, even at at 1 they provide everything needed about the character, and 3 copy is extremely easy to get, the game give you so much gems to roll you won't even notice.\n\n3. What does the uprgade these guys keep crying about?, 3 are actual gameplay mechanic, the other are literally just bonus, from 4 to 12 are, with the exception of notch 7 and 14, they are ALL small stat buff, 7 is over charge to your ult, this is easy to get and you can reach here pretty easily, and that's about it, 14 gave your ult charge card a buff, you mostly don't need this.\n\n4. Notice how i said you can farm copy, every 10 day the shop refresh and give you a copy for 500 lantern, lantern you get for rolling, this count even for normal pulls which they gave you a shi ton off, literally just play normally and get 1000 of them every ten days, so, if you get unlucky and only roll 1 copy?, 1 month and that unit get to 4, it is that easy.",
